# India-Specific Whitelist for Pi-hole
# Critical domains that must NOT be blocked to avoid breaking Indian services
# Managed via pihole-updatelists / pihole-cloud-updater
# Updated: 2026-11-08

# ========================================================
# === UPI / PAYMENT INFRASTRUCTURE ===
# ========================================================
# NPCI (National Payments Corporation of India) - powers UPI, RuPay, IMPS
